      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. these are a good start for the vibe. but i gotta be honest, they feel a bit... i don't know, a little \"old school\" movie trope-y? like, they all feel very white/European/latino. \n\ni want this city to feel more modern and diverse, actually. like a real urban center today. can you give me a few more descriptions for people in that same neighborhood, but make them feel more like the actual demographic breakdown you'd see in a high-crime, inner-city area? maybe some more variety in terms of background so it feels less like a 1940s movie and more like a real street today.",
      "source": "evaluator"
